tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/759944/000075994426000028/cfg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc. is headquartered in Providence, Rhode Island. We offer a broad range of retail and commercial banking products and services to individuals, small businesses, middle-market companies, large corporations, and institutions. Our products and services are offered through more than 1,000 branches in 14 states and the District of Columbia and 75 retail and commercial non-branch offices, though certain lines of business serve national markets.","zh":"公民金融集團公司總部位於羅德島州普羅維登斯。我們為個人、小型企業、中型市場公司、大型企業和機構提供廣泛的零售和商業銀行產品和服務。我們的產品和服務透過 14 個州和哥倫比亞特區的 1,000 多個分支機構以及 75 個零售和商業非分支機構提供，但某些業務服務於全國市場。"},{"en":"At December 31, 2025, we had total assets of $226.4 billion, total deposits of $183.3 billion, and total stockholders' equity of $26.3 billion. In addition, we had total client assets of $61.9 billion, including assets under management of $35.9 billion, representing assets for which continuous and regular supervisory or management services are provided, and transactional assets of $26.0 billion, representing assets for which execution, custody, recordkeeping, reporting, and other services are provided.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，我們的總資產為2,264億美元，總存款為1,833億美元，總股東權益為263億美元。此外，我們的客戶總資產為619億美元，其中管理資產為359億美元，代表提供持續和定期監督或管理服務的資產；交易資產為260億美元，代表提供執行、託管、記錄保存、報告和其他服務的資產。"},{"en":"We are a BHC incorporated under Delaware state law in 1984, and our primary federal regulator is the FRB. CBNA is our banking subsidiary, whose primary federal regulator is the OCC.","zh":"我們是一家於 1984 年根據特拉華州法律成立的 BHC，我們的主要聯邦監管機構是 FRB。 CBNA 是我們的銀行子公司，其主要聯邦監管機構是 OCC。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We manage our business through two primary business segments: Consumer Banking and Commercial Banking. Our activities outside these segments are classified as Other and primarily includes treasury and community development operations, along with other unallocated assets, liabilities, capital, revenues, provision (benefit) for credit losses, and expenses, including income tax expense (benefit). For additional information regarding our business segments see the \"Business Segments\" section of Item 7 and Note 24 in Item 8.","zh":"我們透過兩個主要業務部門管理我們的業務：消費者銀行業務和商業銀行業務。我們在這些部門之外的活動被歸類為“其他”，主要包括財務和社區發展業務，以及其他未分配的資產、負債、資本、收入、信貸損失撥備（收益）和費用，包括所得稅費用（收益）。有關我們業務部門的更多資訊，請參閱第 7 項的「業務部門」部分和第 8 項的附註 24。"},{"en":"Consumer Banking serves consumer customers and small businesses, with products and services that include deposits, mortgage and home equity lending, credit cards, small business loans, and wealth management solutions largely across our 14-state traditional banking footprint. We also offer education and point-of-sale finance loans in addition to select digital deposit products nationwide. Citizens Private Bank and Private Wealth integrate banking services and wealth management solutions to serve high- and ultra-high-net-worth individuals and families, as well as investors, entrepreneurs, and businesses.","zh":"消費者銀行業務為消費者客戶和小型企業提供服務，提供的產品和服務包括存款、抵押貸款和房屋淨值貸款、信用卡、小型企業貸款和財富管理解決方案，主要涵蓋我們 14 個州的傳統銀行業務。除了全國精選的數位存款產品外，我們還提供教育和銷售點金融貸款。公民私人銀行和私人財富整合銀行服務和財富管理解決方案，為高淨值和超高淨值個人和家庭以及投資者、企業家和企業提供服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The financial services industry is highly competitive. Our retail branch footprint is predominantly in the New England, Mid-Atlantic, and Midwest regions, and our Private Bank footprint includes offices in California, Florida, New York, and Massachusetts. Certain lines of our business also serve national markets. We face competition within these markets from community banks, super-regional and national financial institutions, credit unions, savings and loan associations, mortgage banking firms, consumer finance companies, securities brokerage firms, insurance companies, money market funds, hedge funds, and private equity firms. Some of our larger competitors may offer a broader array of products, pricing, and structure alternatives to their customers, while some smaller competitors may have more liberal lending policies and processes. In addition, some of our competitors are not subject ","zh":"金融服務業競爭激烈。我們的零售分行主要分佈在新英格蘭、大西洋中部和中西部地區，私人銀行業務包括加州、佛羅裡達州、紐約州和麻薩諸塞州的辦事處。我們的某些業務也服務於全國市場。我們在這些市場中面臨來自社區銀行、超區域和國家金融機構、信用合作社、儲蓄和貸款協會、抵押銀行公司、消費金融公司、證券經紀公司、保險公司、貨幣市場基金、對沖基金和私募股權公司的競爭。我們的一些較大的競爭對手可能會為其客戶提供更廣泛的產品、定價和結構選擇，而一些較小的競爭對手可能會有更自由的貸款政策和流程。此外，我們的部分競爭對手不受影響"},{"en":"In Consumer Banking, the industry has become increasingly dependent on and oriented toward technology-driven delivery systems, permitting transactions to be conducted through online and mobile channels. In addition, technology has lowered barriers to entry and made it possible for non-bank institutions to attract funds and provide lending and other financial products and services. The emergence of digital-only banking models has increased and we expect this trend to continue. These models are typically able to offer higher rates on deposit products than traditional retail banking institutions given their lower cost structure. The primary factors driving competition for loans and deposits are interest rates, fees charged, tailored value propositions to different customer segments, customer service levels, convenience, including branch locations and hours of operation, and the range of pro","zh":"在消費者銀行業務中，該行業越來越依賴並面向技術驅動的交付系統，允許透過線上和行動管道進行交易。此外，科技降低了准入門檻，使非銀行機構能夠吸引資金並提供貸款和其他金融產品和服務。純數位銀行模式的出現增加，我們預期這一趨勢將持續下去。由於成本結構較低，這些模式通常能夠提供比傳統零售銀行機構更高的存款產品利率。推動貸款和存款競爭的主要因素是利率、收取的費用、針對不同客戶群的客製化價值主張、客戶服務水準、便利性（包括分行地點和營業時間）以及專業範圍。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Consumer Banking","val":6224000000,"zh":"消費銀行業務"},{"name":"Commercial Banking","val":2773000000,"zh":"商業銀行"}],"total":8247000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Capital Markets Fees","val":485000000,"zh":"資本市場費用"},{"name":"Service Chargesand Fees","val":442000000,"zh":"服務費及費用"},{"name":"Wealth Fees","val":360000000,"zh":"財富費用"},{"name":"Card Fees","val":335000000,"zh":"卡費"},{"name":"Other Banking Fees","val":13000000,"zh":"其他銀行費用"}],"total":8247000000}},"peers":["TFC","MTB","ZION","KEY","SYF"]}}